# Normalize all text to LF in the repo and on checkout, on every platform.
# A consumer's own .gitattributes does not reach into this repo when it is
# mounted as a submodule, so without this rule a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF. The host keeps byte-identical copies of a
# few scripts (its docs/mirrored-paths.txt) and compares them with cmp, which
# would then fail, and CRLF shell scripts do not run under bash.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
